       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.                      TCDERNLD.
       AUTHOR.                          ANNETTE TREUDLER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.                    JAN. 1988.
       DATE-COMPILED.                   CURRENT-DATE.
      *REMARKS.
      ***************************************************************
      **                                                           **
      **D       T C D E R N L D                                    **
      **                                                           **
      **D  CORPORATE AND LOCAL CODE RENAME PROGRAM.                **
      **D  THIS PROGRAM ALLOWS THE USER TO ENTER PRESENT CODE AND  **
      **D  NEW CODE.                                               **
      **                                                           **
      *C   01DEC1993         DAVE PLUM          REQUEST #6432       *
      *C   REWORKED THE METHOD BY WHICH THIS PROGRAM DETERMINES     *
      *C   WHETHER OR NOT THE PLANT EXECUTING THIS PROGRAM USES THE *
      *C   CSAS SUSBSYSTEM.  THE EXISTANCE OF A RECORD WITH THE KEY *
      *C   "CSAS" IN MPLTINFO (MCFPCS0500) WILL INDICATE THAT CSAS  *
      *C   IS USED.  WHEN A PLANT USES CSAS, MANY ADDITIONAL EDIT   *
      *C   CHECKS MUST BE PERFORMED.                                *
      *C                                                            *
      *C  07APR1994          DAVE PLUM                              *
      *C  RECOMPILED TO PICK UP AN UPDATED VERSION OF COPYLIB       *
      *C  MEMBER "PLANTS".                                          *
      *C                                                            *
      *C  06JUN1996    CA YODER                                     *
      *C  MODIFIED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.                    *
      *C                                                            *
      *C  24APR1997          DAVE PLUM                              *
      *C  RECOMPILED TO PICK UP AN UPDATED VERSION OF COPYLIB       *
      *C  MEMBER "PLANTS".                                          *
      *C                                                            *
      *C  19DEC1997          DAVE PLUM                              *
      *C  RECOMPILED TO PICK UP AN UPDATED VERSION OF COPYLIB       *
      *C  MEMBER "PLANTS".                                          *
      *C                                                            *
      *C  07DEC1998          DAVE PLUM                              *
      *C  REVISED TO PREVENT ATTEMPTS TO RENAME CODE "X" TO         *
      *C  CODE "X".  IN OTHER WORDS, WE MUST BLOCK ATTEMPTS WHERE   *
      *C  THE OLD CODE IS THE SAME AS THE NEW CODE.                 *
      ***************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.                 IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.                 IBM-AS400.

       SPECIAL-NAMES.   C01 IS NEW-PAGE
                        I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZCDERNLD-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT RENAME-CODE-FILE       ASSIGN TO DATABASE-DCDRNFIL.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MSTORERM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MACTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DTRANS-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-I-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  MSTORERM-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-I-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0200  OF MCFLCS0201.

       FD  MACTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MACTINFO-I-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0100  OF MCFLCA0101.

       FD  DTRANS-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DTRANS-I-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0700  OF MCFLCA0701.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF ZCDERNLD.

       FD  RENAME-CODE-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 14 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS RENAME-CODE-REC.
       01  RENAME-CODE-REC.
           05  RENAME-OLD-CODE           PIC X(7).
           05  RENAME-NEW-CODE           PIC X(7).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ***************************************************************
      **               W O R K I N G   S T O R A G E               **
      ***************************************************************
       01  INDX                          PIC 9    VALUE 1.
       01  S-INDX                        PIC X(5) VALUE "NNNNN".
       01  S-INDX-RDF REDEFINES S-INDX.
           05  CHK-INDX  OCCURS 5 TIMES PIC X(1).
       01  CODE-CHK.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(4).
           05  CODE-CHK-5                PIC X(1).
           05  CODE-CHK-6                PIC X(1).
           05  CODE-CHK-7                PIC X(1).
       01  CODE-FLAG                     PIC X(1) VALUE SPACES.
           88  CODE-IS-CORP                       VALUE "C".
           88  CODE-IS-PLANT                      VALUE "P".
       01  CSAS-FLAG                     PIC X(1) VALUE SPACES.

      *01  TWO-SEC-DELAY.
      *    05  FILLER                    PIC X    VALUE %33.
      *    05  FILLER                    PIC X    VALUE "@".
      *    05  FILLER                    PIC X    VALUE %33.
      *    05  FILLER                    PIC X    VALUE "@".

       01  ERROR-SW                      PIC X    VALUE "N".
           88  NO-ERRORS                          VALUE "N".
       01  ACTIVITY-SW                   PIC X    VALUE "N".
       01  CSAS-SEQ                      PIC S9(5) VALUE ZEROS.
       01  CSIS-SEQ                      PIC S9(5) VALUE ZEROS.
       01  PLT-CODE                      PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
      *-------- ACCOUNT FOR CENTURY.
       01  CLOSING-DATE-CN.
           05  CLOSING-DATE-CC           PIC X(2).
           05  CLOSING-DATE-YMD.
               10  CLOSING-DATE-YY       PIC X(2).
               10  CLOSING-DATE-MM       PIC X(2).
               10  CLOSING-DATE-DD       PIC X(2).

       01  HOLD-DATE-CN.
           05  HOLD-DATE-CC              PIC X(2).
           05  HOLD-DATE-YMD.
               10  HOLD-DATE-YY          PIC X(2).
               10  HOLD-DATE-MM          PIC X(2).
               10  HOLD-DATE-DD          PIC X(2).

      ***************************************************************
      **               C O M M A N D    A R E A                    **
      ***************************************************************
       01  COMMAND-AREA.
           05  QCMDEXC-BXCDERNM.
               10  STRDBRDR-BXCDERNM  PIC X(36) VALUE
               "STRDBRDR FILE(QJOBSRC) MBR(MCXCDERN)".
               10  DBR-BXCDERNM-PARM2 PIC S9(10)V9(5) COMP-3 VALUE 36.

       COPY CCHKOBJ IN COPYLIB.

       COPY CCRTFILE IN COPYLIB.

       COPY CDLTFILE IN COPYLIB.

      ***************************************************************
      **              S U B P R O G R A M   A R E A S              **
      ***************************************************************
       COPY PLANTS     IN COPYLIB.

       COPY CWHO       IN COPYLIB.

       COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.

       COPY TDATECHK   IN COPYLIB.

      ***************************************************************
      **                    D A T A B A S E                        **
      ***************************************************************

       COPY DATAB      IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DBCSACCT   IN COPYLIB.

       01  DATASET-NAMES.
           05  DSET-NAME             PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
           05  DSET-MPLTINFO         PIC X(16) VALUE "MPLTINFO;".
           05  DSET-MSTORERM         PIC X(16) VALUE "MSTORERM;".
           05  DSET-MACTINFO         PIC X(16) VALUE "MACCOUNT-INFO;".
           05  DSET-DTRANS           PIC X(16) VALUE "DTRANS;".

       01  ITEMS-LISTINGS.
           05  ALL-ITEMS                 PIC X(2)  VALUE "@;".
           05  CODE-SEARCH               PIC X(10) VALUE "MATL-CODE;".

       01  ARG-VALUES.
           05  CODE-ARG                  PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PLT-ARG                   PIC X(4)  VALUE "P 01".
           05  CSAS-ARG                  PIC X(4)  VALUE "MTED".

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACE.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACE.

      ***************************************************************
      **             D A T A B A S E    B U F F E R S              **
      ***************************************************************

       COPY MSTORERM   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY MPLTINFO   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY MACTINFO   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DTRANS     IN COPYLIB.

      ***************************************************************
      **       T E R M I N A L   I / O   D A T A   A R E A         **
      ***************************************************************

       01  CODE-SCREEN.
           05  CODE-LOAD-AREA           PIC X(70).
           05  CODE-LOAD-RDF REDEFINES CODE-LOAD-AREA.
               10  CODE-RENAME-ROW          OCCURS 5 TIMES.
                   15  CODE-RENAME-OLD  PIC X(7).
                   15  CODE-RENAME-NEW  PIC X(7).

           05  DE-ERRLINE               PIC X(79).
           05  DE-MSGLINE               PIC X(79).

       COPY DISPDATA IN COPYLIB.

       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.

      ***************************************************************
      **             V I E W   W O R K   A R E A                   **
      ***************************************************************

       COPY VCOMAREA   IN COPYLIB.

       01  SAVE-LASTKEY                 PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE ZERO.

      ***************************************************************
      **      N A T I V E    L A N G U A G E   S U P P O R T       **
      ***************************************************************

       COPY LANGUAGE   IN COPYLIB.

       01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN               PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 76.
       01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN               PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 76.
       01  FIELD-NUMBER                 PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 1.

       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT                 PIC X(64) VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD                  PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.

       COPY CATREAD IN COPYLIB.

      ***************************************************************
      **###########################################################**
      ***************************************************************
      **                                                           **
      **           P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N            **
      **                                                           **
      ***************************************************************
      **###########################################################**
      ***************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       00-MAIN-PGRM.
           PERFORM 10-HSK                THRU  10-HSK-X.

      *----  NO PROCESSING WILL BE ALLOWED IF THE PLANT USES CSAS AND
      *----  ANY OF THE FOLLOWING ARE TRUE
      *----     1) MONTH-END PROCESSING COULD BE RUNNING
      *----           (CURRENT DATE IS GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO THE
      *----            CSAS MONTH-END DATE)
      *----  OR 2) ONE OR MORE CSIS ABSTFILES HAVE NOT BEEN PROCESSED
      *----        INTO CSAS YET
      *----  OR 3) THERE ARE ONE OR MORE ACCOUNTS PAYABLE MANIFEST FILES
      *----        TO BE PROCESSED INTO CSAS
      *----           (FILE MANSTR01 EXISTS)

           IF NO-ERRORS
               PERFORM 60-MAIN           THRU  60-MAIN-X.

           PERFORM 20-EOJ                THRU  20-EOJ-X.
           GOBACK.

       10-HSK.
           MOVE "TCDERNLD" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           MOVE "N"        TO ERROR-SW.

           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I,
                      MSTORERM-I,
                      MACTINFO-I,
                      DTRANS-I.

           MOVE "P 02"                   TO PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-I-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ ERROR * MPLTINFO * 10-HSK"
                                         TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE PLT-ARG              TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               GO TO 99-BLOWUP.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-SEQ             TO CSIS-SEQ.

           MOVE "P 01"                   TO PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-I-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ2 ERROR * MPLTINFO * 10-HSK"
                                         TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE PLT-ARG              TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               GO TO 99-BLOWUP.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY         TO  WHICH-PLANT.

           MOVE "CSAS"                   TO PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-I-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE "N" TO CSAS-FLAG
               ELSE
                   MOVE "READ3 ERROR * MPLTINFO * 10-HSK"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   MOVE PLT-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                   GO TO 99-BLOWUP
           ELSE
               MOVE "Y" TO CSAS-FLAG.

      *------ IF THIS PLANT IS NOT USING CSAS, SKIP OVER THE FOLLOWING
      *------ "CSAS" EDITS.
           IF CSAS-FLAG = "N"
               GO TO 10-HSK-X.

      *------ GET THE CSAS MONTH-END DATE FROM KEY=MTED OF MACCOUNT-INFO
           MOVE "MTED"   TO CSAS-ARG.
           MOVE CSAS-ARG TO INFOKEY OF MACTINFO-I-REC.
           READ MACTINFO-I INTO BUF-MACCT-INFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ ERROR MACTINFO * 10-HSK"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE CSAS-ARG     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               GO TO 99-BLOWUP.

           MOVE MACCT-MONTH-END-DATE  TO CLOSING-DATE-YMD.
      *------ ACCOUNT FOR CENTURY.
           IF CLOSING-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19"              TO CLOSING-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20"              TO CLOSING-DATE-CC.

      *------ GET THE CSAS NEXT ABSTFILE TO BE PROCESSED VALUE FROM
      *------ KEY=SEQ OF MACCOUNT-INFO
           MOVE "SEQ"    TO CSAS-ARG.
           MOVE CSAS-ARG TO INFOKEY OF MACTINFO-I-REC.
           READ MACTINFO-I INTO BUF-MACCT-INFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ2 ERROR MACTINFO * 10-HSK"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE CSAS-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               GO TO 99-BLOWUP.

           MOVE MACCT-ABST-SEQ    TO CSAS-SEQ.

      *------ GET THE CURRENT DATE USING TDATECHK (YYMMDD FORMAT)
           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
           IF DATE-RET-CODE NOT = 0
               MOVE "ERROR IN TDATECHK"  TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE DATE-RET-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD9 (1)
               GO TO 99-BLOWUP.

      *------ CHECK TO SEE IF CSAS MONTH-END CLOSING PROCEDURE MIGHT
      *------ BE IN PROGRESS
           MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT TO  HOLD-DATE-YMD.
      *------ ACCOUNT FOR CENTURY.
           IF HOLD-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19"     TO  HOLD-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20"     TO  HOLD-DATE-CC.
           IF HOLD-DATE-CN = CLOSING-DATE-CN OR
              HOLD-DATE-CN > CLOSING-DATE-CN
      *** CSAS END-OF-MONTH PROCEDURE IN PROGESS -
      *** NO PROCESSING ALLOWED
               MOVE 66243 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
               PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
               PERFORM 10-HSK-ERRORS THRU 10-HSK-E-X
               GO TO 10-HSK-X.

      *------ CHECK TO SEE IF ALL "ABSTFILES" HAVE BEEN PROCESSED INTO
      *------ CSAS
           IF CSAS-SEQ < CSIS-SEQ AND CSAS-SEQ NOT = ZEROS
      *** CSIS CUTOFF FILES WAITING TO BE PROCESSED INTO CSAS -
      *** NO PROCESSING DONE
               MOVE 66242 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
               PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
               PERFORM 10-HSK-ERRORS THRU 10-HSK-E-X
               GO TO 10-HSK-X.

      *------ CHECK TO SEE IF ALL ACCOUNTS PAYABLE MANIFEST FILES
      *------ HAVE BEEN PROCESSED INTO CSAS
           MOVE "MANSTR01" TO CHKOBJ-FILE-NAME.
           CALL "CCHKOBJ" USING CHKOBJ-FILE-NAME,
                                CHKOBJ-RETURN-STATUS.
           IF CHKOBJ-RETURN-STATUS = "00"
      *** MANIFEST WAITING TO BE PROCESSED -
      *** NO PROCESSING DONE
               MOVE 66245 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
               PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
               PERFORM 10-HSK-ERRORS THRU 10-HSK-E-X
               GO TO 10-HSK-X.

       10-HSK-X.
           EXIT.

       10-HSK-ERRORS.
           DISPLAY MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           MOVE "Y"              TO ERROR-SW.

       10-HSK-E-X.
           EXIT.


       20-EOJ.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE,
                 MPLTINFO-I,
                 MSTORERM-I,
                 MACTINFO-I
                 DTRANS-I.

       20-EOJ-X.
           EXIT.

      ***************************************************************
      **                                                           **
      **                       6 0 - M A I N                       **
      **                                                           **
      ***************************************************************

       60-MAIN.
      *------ CHECK TO SEE IF FILE CRACTIVE EXISTS.  IF IT DOES
      *------ EXIST, ANOTHER CODE RENAME PROCESS IS ACTIVE (ONLINE
      *------ USER, OR THE CODE RENAME BATCH JOB)
           MOVE "CRACTIVE" TO CHKOBJ-FILE-NAME.
           CALL "CCHKOBJ" USING CHKOBJ-FILE-NAME,
                                CHKOBJ-RETURN-STATUS.
           IF CHKOBJ-RETURN-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE "CRACTIVE"      TO VIEW-NFNAME
               PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN
               GO TO 60-MAIN-X.

      *------ CREATE FILE CRACTIVE USING CCRTFILE
           MOVE "CRACTIVE" TO CCRTFILE-FILE.
           MOVE 1    TO CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH,
                        CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS,
                        CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT,
                        CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS.
           CALL "CCRTFILE" USING CCRTFILE-LIBRARY,
                                 CCRTFILE-FILE,
                                 CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH,
                                 CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS,
                                 CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT,
                                 CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS,
                                 CCRTFILE-STATUS.
           IF CCRTFILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "CREATE COMMAND FAILED"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE CCRTFILE-STATUS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               MOVE CCRTFILE-FILE   TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
               GO TO 99-BLOWUP.

      *------ DELETE FILE DCDRNFIL, IF IT EXISTS
           MOVE "DCDRNFIL"     TO  DLTFILE-FILE-NAME.
           CALL "CDLTFILE" USING DLTFILE-LIB-NAME,
                                 DLTFILE-FILE-NAME,
                                 DLTFILE-RETURN-STATUS.

      *------ CREATE FILE DCDRNFIL USING CCRTFILE
           MOVE "DCDRNFIL" TO CCRTFILE-FILE.
           MOVE 14   TO CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH.
           MOVE 1000 TO CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS,
                        CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT.
           MOVE 1    TO CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS.
           CALL "CCRTFILE" USING CCRTFILE-LIBRARY,
                                 CCRTFILE-FILE,
                                 CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH,
                                 CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS,
                                 CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT,
                                 CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS,
                                 CCRTFILE-STATUS.
           IF CCRTFILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "CREATE COMMAND FAILED"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE CCRTFILE-STATUS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               MOVE CCRTFILE-FILE   TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
               GO TO 99-BLOWUP.

           OPEN OUTPUT RENAME-CODE-FILE.

           MOVE "RENAMETAB"             TO VIEW-NFNAME.

       60-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE SPACES TO CODE-LOAD-AREA.

       60-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE CODE-SCREEN    TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO CODE-SCREEN.

       60-READ-FIELDS.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
             CLOSE RENAME-CODE-FILE
             MOVE "DCDRNFIL" TO DLTFILE-FILE-NAME
             CALL "CDLTFILE" USING DLTFILE-LIB-NAME,
                                   DLTFILE-FILE-NAME,
                                   DLTFILE-RETURN-STATUS
             IF DLTFILE-RETURN-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DELETE COMMAND FAILED"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE DLTFILE-RETURN-STATUS    TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               MOVE DLTFILE-FILE-NAME        TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
               GO TO 99-BLOWUP
             ELSE
               MOVE "CRACTIVE"     TO  DLTFILE-FILE-NAME
               CALL "CDLTFILE" USING DLTFILE-LIB-NAME,
                                     DLTFILE-FILE-NAME,
                                     DLTFILE-RETURN-STATUS
               IF DLTFILE-RETURN-STATUS NOT = "00"
                 MOVE "DELETE COMMAND FAILED"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE DLTFILE-RETURN-STATUS    TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE DLTFILE-FILE-NAME        TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 GO TO 99-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                 GO TO 60-MAIN-X.

           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1
               MOVE VIEW-LASTKEY         TO SAVE-LASTKEY.

           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      **** I9: INVALID FUNCTION KEY
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1"           TO IND(99)
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

           MOVE 0 TO INDX.

       60-FIELD-EDITS.
      *--------- VALIDATE CODES ENTERED BY USER
           IF INDX < 5
               ADD 1 TO INDX
           ELSE
               MOVE 1 TO INDX
               GO TO 60-EDIT-CHECKS.

      *** NEW CODE IS REQUIRED WHEN ENTERING OLD CODE
           IF CODE-RENAME-OLD (INDX) NOT = SPACES
               IF CODE-RENAME-NEW (INDX) = SPACES
                   MOVE  66241 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
                   PERFORM 602-SET-FIELD-NUMBER THRU 602-SFN-X
                   GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM
               ELSE
                   IF CODE-RENAME-OLD (INDX) = CODE-RENAME-NEW (INDX)
                       MOVE "OLD CODE AND NEW CODE CANNOT BE THE SAME"
                         TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                       PERFORM 602-SET-FIELD-NUMBER THRU 602-SFN-X
                       GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM
                   ELSE
                       GO TO 60-FIELD-EDITS.

      *--------- INITIALIZE THE INDEXES
           MOVE 0 TO INDX.

       60-EDIT-CHECKS.
      *--------- VALIDATE CODES ENTERED BY USER
           IF INDX < 5
               ADD 1 TO INDX
           ELSE
               MOVE 1 TO INDX
               GO TO 60-WRITE-CODES.

           IF CODE-RENAME-OLD (INDX) = SPACES
               GO TO 60-EDIT-CHECKS.

       60-VALIDATE-CODES.
      *---------  VALIDATE THE OLD CODE
           MOVE CODE-RENAME-OLD (INDX)   TO CODE-ARG,
                                            BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).

           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-I-REC.
           READ MSTORERM-I INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
      **** STORES CODES DOES NOT EXIST ****
               MOVE   19 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE    9 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
               PERFORM 601-SET-FIELD-NUMBER THRU 601-SFN-X
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM
           ELSE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "READ MSTORERM ERROR * 60-VALIDATE-CODES"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   MOVE CODE-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                   GO TO 99-BLOWUP.

      **** CHECK TO MAKE SURE CODE IS NOT 'NON-STR'
           IF CORP-CODE = "NON-STR"
               MOVE   3 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE 189 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
               PERFORM 601-SET-FIELD-NUMBER THRU 601-SFN-X
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

      **** CHECK TO SEE THAT CODE IS NOT FROZEN *****
           IF STR-STATE = "F"
      ****   CODE FROZEN FOR INVENTORY - NO PROCESSING ALLOWED  ****
               MOVE   3 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE   8 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
               PERFORM 601-SET-FIELD-NUMBER THRU 601-SFN-X
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

      **** IF PLANT IS RUNNING CSAS - CHECK ACTIVITY DATE
           IF CSAS-FLAG = "Y"
               IF HOLD-DATE-CN = STR-ACT-DATE-CN
      ***  ACTIVITY HAS BEEN POSTED TODAY - NO PROCESSING ALLOWED
                   MOVE 66246 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
                   PERFORM 601-SET-FIELD-NUMBER THRU 601-SFN-X
                   GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

      *--------- VALIDATE THE NEW CODE
           MOVE CODE-RENAME-NEW (INDX)   TO CODE-CHK,
                                            CODE-ARG,
                                            BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).

           IF ((CODE-CHK-5 IS NUMERIC OR CODE-CHK-5 = SPACE)
             AND (CODE-CHK-6 IS NUMERIC OR CODE-CHK-6 = SPACE)
             AND (CODE-CHK-7 IS NUMERIC OR CODE-CHK-7 = SPACE))
               MOVE "C"                  TO CODE-FLAG
           ELSE
               MOVE "P"                  TO CODE-FLAG.

           IF CODE-IS-PLANT AND NO-PLANT-CODES-PLANT
      ***  LOCAL CODES ARE INVALID AT YOUR PLANT
               MOVE 66247 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
               PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
               PERFORM 602-SET-FIELD-NUMBER THRU 602-SFN-X
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-I-REC.
           READ MSTORERM-I INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF CODE-IS-CORP
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
      ****   CORPORATE CODE DOES NOT EXIST  ****
                       MOVE   19 TO LANG-SETNUM
                       MOVE    9 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                       PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
                       PERFORM 602-SET-FIELD-NUMBER THRU 602-SFN-X
                       GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM
                   ELSE
                       MOVE "READ MSTORERM ERROR * 60-VALIDATE-CODES"
                           TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                       MOVE CODE-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                       GO TO 99-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                       GO TO 60-EDIT-CHECKS
                   ELSE
                       MOVE "READ MSTORERM ERROR * 60-VALIDATE-CODES"
                           TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                       MOVE CODE-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                       GO TO 99-BLOWUP.

      **** CHECK TO MAKE SURE CODE IS NOT 'NON-STR'
           IF CORP-CODE = "NON-STR"
               MOVE   3 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE 189 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
               PERFORM 602-SET-FIELD-NUMBER THRU 602-SFN-X
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.


      **** CHECK TO SEE THAT CODE IS NOT FROZEN *****
           IF STR-STATE = "F"
      ****   CODE FROZEN FOR INVENTORY - NO PROCESSING ALLOWED  ****
               MOVE   3 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE   8 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
               PERFORM 602-SET-FIELD-NUMBER THRU 602-SFN-X
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

      **** IF PLANT IS RUNNING CSAS - CHECK ACTIVITY DATE
           IF CSAS-FLAG = "Y"
               IF HOLD-DATE-CN = STR-ACT-DATE-CN
      ***  ACTIVITY HAS BEEN POSTED TODAY - NO PROCESSING ALLOWED      S     "
                   MOVE 66246 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
                   PERFORM 602-SET-FIELD-NUMBER THRU 602-SFN-X
                   GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM
               ELSE
                   PERFORM 60-CHECK-DTRANS
                   IF ACTIVITY-SW = "Y"
      ***  ACTIVITY HAS BEEN POSTED TODAY - NO PROCESSING ALLOWED      S     "
                       MOVE 66246 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
                       PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
                       PERFORM 602-SET-FIELD-NUMBER THRU 602-SFN-X
                       GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

           IF STR-ONHAND NOT = ZEROS
      *** NEW CODE MUST HAVE ZERO ONHAND - NO PROCESSING ALLOWED       A     "
               MOVE 66248 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
               PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X
               PERFORM 602-SET-FIELD-NUMBER THRU 602-SFN-X
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

           GO TO 60-EDIT-CHECKS.

       60-CHECK-DTRANS.
           MOVE "N"                      TO ACTIVITY-SW.
           MOVE CODE-RENAME-NEW (INDX)   TO CODE-ARG.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO MATLCODE OF DTRANS-I-REC.
           MOVE SPACES   TO TRANSDATE OF DTRANS-I-REC.
           START DTRANS-I KEY = EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   MOVE "START DTRANS * 60-CHECK-DTRANS"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 99-BLOWUP
           ELSE
               PERFORM 60-GET-DTRANS THRU 60-GD-X
               IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG NOT = SPACES
                   GO TO 99-BLOWUP.

       60-GET-DTRANS.
           READ DTRANS-I NEXT INTO BUF-DTRANS
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   GO TO 60-GD-X
               ELSE
                   MOVE "READN DTRANS * 60-GD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 60-GD-X.

           IF MATLCODE OF DTRANS-I-REC NOT = CODE-ARG
               GO TO 60-GD-X.

           IF TRANS-DOCUMENT-NUM NOT = "PROC"
               MOVE "Y"                  TO ACTIVITY-SW
               GO TO 60-GD-X.

           GO TO 60-GET-DTRANS.

       60-GD-X.
           EXIT.

       60-WRITE-CODES.
      *--------- WRITE THE CODES TO THE FILE

           IF CODE-RENAME-OLD (INDX) NOT = SPACES
               MOVE CODE-RENAME-OLD (INDX) TO RENAME-OLD-CODE
               MOVE CODE-RENAME-NEW (INDX) TO RENAME-NEW-CODE
               WRITE RENAME-CODE-REC.

           IF INDX < 5
               ADD 1 TO INDX
               GO TO 60-WRITE-CODES.

      *--------- IF THE USER PRESSED 'f1' TO RUN THE REPORT, EXIT AND SUBMIT
      *--------- THE REPORT
           IF SAVE-LASTKEY = 1
               CLOSE RENAME-CODE-FILE
               PERFORM 603-LAUNCH-BATCH-JOB
               GO TO 60-MAIN-X.

      *---------  CONTINUE WITH A CLEAN BUFFER FOR THE ENTRY OF MORE CODES
           GO TO 60-PUT-BUFFER.

       60-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

       601-SET-FIELD-NUMBER.
           IF INDX = 1
               MOVE  11                  TO FIELD-NUMBER
           ELSE
           IF INDX = 2
               MOVE  13                  TO FIELD-NUMBER
           ELSE
           IF INDX = 3
               MOVE  15                  TO FIELD-NUMBER
           ELSE
           IF INDX = 4
               MOVE  17                  TO FIELD-NUMBER
           ELSE
               MOVE  19                  TO FIELD-NUMBER.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE-MSGLINE.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND(99), IND(FIELD-NUMBER).

       601-SFN-X.
           EXIT.

       602-SET-FIELD-NUMBER.
           IF INDX = 1
               MOVE  12                  TO FIELD-NUMBER
           ELSE
           IF INDX = 2
               MOVE  14                  TO FIELD-NUMBER
           ELSE
           IF INDX = 3
               MOVE  16                  TO FIELD-NUMBER
           ELSE
           IF INDX = 4
               MOVE  18                  TO FIELD-NUMBER
           ELSE
               MOVE  20                  TO FIELD-NUMBER.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE-MSGLINE.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND(99), IND(FIELD-NUMBER).

       602-SFN-X.
           EXIT.

       603-LAUNCH-BATCH-JOB.
      ***  LAUNCHING JOB TO PERFORM CODE RENAME PROCEDURE ****
           MOVE   12                     TO LANG-SETNUM.
           MOVE   11                     TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 99-CATREAD THRU 99-CATREAD-X.
           DISPLAY MESSAGE-BUFFER.

           CALL "QCMDEXC" USING STRDBRDR-BXCDERNM, DBR-BXCDERNM-PARM2.
      *    DISPLAY TWO-SEC-DELAY.

      ***************************************************************
      **                      BLOWUP ROUTINE                       **
      ***************************************************************
       99-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
               BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.

       99-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
       99-CATREAD-X.
           EXIT.
